# =============================================================================
# GRPPREP SUITE (2026-10-03) - step 1 of the grouped view's List layout
#
# The grouped PDF export and the "in X of Y groups" count used to ask jQuery
# :visible - where a group is ON SCREEN. A layout that hides group wrappers
# (List) would then have emptied the PDF's columns, closed open groups during a
# PDF, and miscounted. Step 1 makes all three read the group's own state. This
# suite loads each scenario against the BASELINE (the build before) and the
# CANDIDATE and requires
#   D-*  identical output where nothing may change: a single-level grouping's
#        PDF (whole) and the open/closed state it leaves, a nested grouping's
#        innermost tables under an OPEN branch, the count text, the email embed
#        and the CSV/TSV/JSON exports
#   E-*  no page errors on either build
#   L-*  on the candidate: a group wrapper hidden by a class of its own (the
#        List stand-in in harness.html) changes neither the PDF nor the count;
#        a PDF leaves every group open or closed as it found it; and a nested
#        grouping's PDF gives EVERY innermost table its columns. The last two
#        were broken in the build before for groups inside a CLOSED branch (it
#        printed them blank and closed the open ones) - so they are L-, not D-.
#   I-*  observations printed for both builds, never asserted
#
#   py -3 run.py                               candidate = live js\main.js, baseline = newest js\main.js.bak-*-grpprep
#   py -3 run.py --candidate F --baseline B    any two builds (the stage vs live before the deploy)
#   py -3 run.py --control                     candidate := baseline: exactly the L-*list asserts go RED
#   py -3 run.py --mutant NAME / --mutants     one line of the candidate put back or broken
#   --scn a,b                                  a subset of scenarios
# Headless Edge over CDP; stages into %TEMP%; writes nothing to the webroot.
# =============================================================================
